* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Vendored Swagger UI assets (internal/core/api/swaggerui/assets). Minified
# third-party bundles: not ours to review, and a diff of them is noise that
# hides the one line that matters — the version in swaggerui.go.
internal/core/api/swaggerui/assets/** linguist-vendored
internal/core/api/swaggerui/assets/*.js -diff
internal/core/api/swaggerui/assets/*.css -diff
